function cleanTestDaFProgress(input){const base={...newProgress(),...input,settings:{...newProgress().settings,...input?.settings}};const wordIds=new Set(DATA?.words?.map(w=>w.id)||[]),setIds=new Set(allLessons.map(l=>l.id));base.words=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(base.words||{}).filter(([id])=>wordIds.has(id)));base.favorites=[...new Set((base.favorites||[]).filter(id=>wordIds.has(id)))];base.ratings=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(base.ratings||{}).filter(([id,value])=>wordIds.has(id)&&Object.hasOwn(ratingLabels,value)));base.completedSets=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(base.completedSets||{}).filter(([id,value])=>setIds.has(id)&&value===true));base._favorites=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(base._favorites||{}).filter(([id])=>wordIds.has(id)));base._clocks=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(base._clocks||{}).filter(([key])=>{const word=key.match(/^(?:rating|fav):(.+)$/);const set=key.match(/^set:(.+)$/);return (!word||wordIds.has(word[1]))&&(!set||setIds.has(set[1]));}));if(base.matchSession){const ids=base.matchSession.ids?.filter(id=>wordIds.has(id))||[];base.matchSession=ids.length?{...base.matchSession,ids,target:0}:null;}base.xp=0;return base;}
function loadProgress(){try{const obj=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));if(obj?.version===1&&obj.words&&obj.days&&Array.isArray(obj.favorites))return {...newProgress(),...obj,settings:{...newProgress().settings,...obj.settings}};}catch{}return newProgress();}
let storageWarning=false;
